DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     This function associates a specific driver with a given device node in
     the tree.  It is typically used in DEVICE_IDENTIFY(9) functions to add
     devices to a bus that does not support doing so automatically, such as
     the ISA bus.

